  m_text: 'to=Self with toLink=Movement Body Link: the mode-slot DOUBLES as the link-hunt root. The actor reaches the leader''s EntityLinkRoot via its empty-schema source, so ''to'' resolves to the orbiting YELLOW leader (not the actor itself). Distance to the linked entity feeds the stat. If the chain failed it would silently fall back to targets.Get(Self)=0.'
